[17592186420982 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420968 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420971 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420974 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420975 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1077 "selection" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420971 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420982 1079 #uuid "98df9e75-9a1d-5fb1-8cca-cc1e11240df1" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420961 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420962 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420972 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420976 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420980 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1077 "selection" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420976 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420983 1079 #uuid "e6a82ca7-01c6-5a96-826e-af1700b4e1e7" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420963 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420965 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420973 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420977 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420978 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1077 "selection" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420973 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420984 1079 #uuid "f342874d-f251-593c-aa5a-839fe9ae8390" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420984 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1069 "q-181956" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1071 "If $A={-2,2}$ and $B={c,d},$ which of the following elements belong to $(A\\times B)\\times B?$\n\n- $(-2,d,c)$\n- $(-2,(c,d))$\n- $((2,d),c)$" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1072 #uuid "1c44203d-f0c3-504e-a004-3addf0955223" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420985 1074 "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\nIn this case, $A\\times B$ consists of every combination of ${-2,2}$ with ${c,d},$ as shown in the schematic below.\n\n![](images/98/98e7cfca515290b952ea5aefc9b2516a5cd6a68de0dc048c2075128e6c60b651.png)\n\nHence, the set $A\\times B$ is given by\n\n$$\nA\\times B={(-2,c),(-2,d),(2,c),(2,d)}.\n$$\n\nNote that \n\n$$\n|A\\times B|=|A|\\cdot |B|=2\\cdot 2=4.\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian product\n\n$$\n(A\\times B)\\times B\n$$\n\nconsists of every combination of $A\\times B$ and $B,$ as shown in the schematic below.\n\n![](images/1e/1e96aeb1c5bfb1f9faa590a8eb8b01528a1ce9431a3f1ceac92b156a9bdde221.png)\n\nNote that \n\n$$\n|(A\\times B)\\times B|=|A\\times B|\\cdot |B|=4\\cdot 2=8.\n$$\n\nFrom the given options, we see that only $((2,d),c)\\in (A\\times B)\\times B.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420983 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1069 "q-182014" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1071 "For the sets $A={0,1,2},$ $B={4,6,8},$ and $C=A\\times B,$ determine which of the following statements are true.\n\n- $(0,2)\\in C$\n- $(1,8)\\in C$\n- $(0,6)\\in C$" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1072 #uuid "1f4365e0-4fb2-5b82-b78f-2c814bc881e5" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420986 1074 "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\nIn this case, the schematic for $A\\times B$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/12/12d1b94cc6d53954a9c164bd069f77fcddc7a46de2c1701c1f4cdfc608eef185.png)\n\nHence, the set $C=A\\times B$ is given by\n\n$$\nC={(0,4),(0,6),(0,8),(1,4),(1,6),(1,8),(2,4),(2,6),(2,8)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420981 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1069 "q-80895" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1071 "What is the cardinality of $Z\\times X$ for $Z={p,q,r}$ and $X={-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3}?$" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1072 #uuid "619a2767-aaa5-5efa-bd74-7ab475387f3d" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420987 1074 "For any two finite sets $Z$ and $X,$ the cardinality of $Z\\times X$ is\n\n$$\n|Z\\times X|=|Z|\\cdot |X|.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|Z\\times X| & =|Z|\\cdot |X| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =21.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420988 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420982 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420988 1069 "q-80443" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420988 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420988 1071 "What is the cardinality of $B\\times A$ for $B={1,2,3,...,100}$ and $A={a}?$" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420988 1072 #uuid "8aca702c-860b-5bdc-89e7-b6ee88897db2" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true] [17592186420988 1074 "For any two finite sets $B$ and $A,$ the cardinality of $B\\times A$ is\n\n$$\n|B\\times A|=|B|\\cdot |A|.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|B\\times A| & =|B|\\cdot |A| \\\\  & =100\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =100.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534424 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-117c917b-7d62-5b51-804f-8f0f908de52c" 17592186420961 "answer-24030462-28a2-5ff6-ab9c-6ac8a212b6d5" 17592186420962 "answer-323a0eaa-c97b-52de-a3bc-ebc72ae2e5d4" 17592186420963 "answer-3bcc3958-b0e2-5ab6-aeba-37976f8695e3" 17592186420964 "answer-3f1c11f8-7017-508a-a025-032d058eefc3" 17592186420965 "answer-4248df2e-bd43-540d-b809-a47cb096e53f" 17592186420966 "answer-46d5e59a-a604-5e1d-a944-0b0db4cf9c5a" 17592186420967 "answer-5427fa39-7620-5a39-b0e5-443eefe2442e" 17592186420968 "answer-5971eb2f-7b93-5176-8493-6729a333bd1c" 17592186420969 "answer-63a9f909-0100-5b97-9f7a-618d75a1ed03" 17592186420970 "answer-6c392020-591e-554e-9445-e43db05bc4ea" 17592186420971 "answer-8a3b603c-2196-5e99-b012-5950a3d2c4b3" 17592186420972 "answer-9c53a0ac-9594-5d9f-871e-69dd75c6ab8e" 17592186420973 "answer-9f0a0c9c-17ab-5998-a126-74c2690405d7" 17592186420974 "answer-a92c961b-342f-5255-926d-25df1da4fb4c" 17592186420975 "answer-c5a110c3-4357-5dd4-8b2e-d63c84712e94" 17592186420976 "answer-c6ed4afd-f54e-59d9-bd0a-604a3f0d6358" 17592186420977 "answer-df07081f-dcec-5eb4-b4c9-6e0e88404217" 17592186420978 "answer-e45089dc-a2a0-5a75-a15b-c75c064e9ae2" 17592186420979 "answer-f94df467-1917-54c6-9462-f00a0bb4ad5a" 17592186420980 "answer-field-2b1f4f72-6f18-5497-b49c-9ae7df83c964" 17592186420981 "answer-field-98df9e75-9a1d-5fb1-8cca-cc1e11240df1" 17592186420982 "answer-field-e6a82ca7-01c6-5a96-826e-af1700b4e1e7" 17592186420983 "answer-field-f342874d-f251-593c-aa5a-839fe9ae8390" 17592186420984 "question-1c44203d-f0c3-504e-a004-3addf0955223" 17592186420985 "question-1f4365e0-4fb2-5b82-b78f-2c814bc881e5" 17592186420986 "question-619a2767-aaa5-5efa-bd74-7ab475387f3d" 